WEBVTT

NOTE CineReels — Revenge of the Wave God — Episode 10 — English subtitles — translation of the actual spoken Arabic dialogue (language: en)
NOTE Transcribed 2026-11-24 from the real episode audio (whisper-small + manual cleanup).

1
00:00:04.720 --> 00:00:06.720
You're putting on a thick layer, man.

2
00:00:06.720 --> 00:00:08.720
Your foot will slip on the board.

3
00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:10.720
This suits cold water, it seems.

4
00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:12.720
At the point where the waves break.

5
00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:14.720
The wax will become sticky and greasy.

6
00:00:14.720 --> 00:00:16.720
And he's teaching a golden champion about wax.

7
00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:18.720
Not about the wax.

8
00:00:18.720 --> 00:00:20.720
But about the water I live in.

9
00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:27.380
Don't boast about never leaving the island.

10
00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:33.760
I wished I'd find you here.

11
00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:42.640
It looked great on you last night.

12
00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:44.640
Let's see how she performs on her own.

13
00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:45.640
Najwa.

14
00:00:45.640 --> 00:00:46.640
This bikini.

15
00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:47.640
Who wears it?

16
00:00:47.640 --> 00:00:53.030
Your manager?

17
00:00:53.030 --> 00:01:01.500
Here she is, asking.

18
00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:03.500
I told her that her board can't do it.

19
00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:05.500
About getting past the drop and into the barrel.

20
00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:07.500
It dives nose-first.
